{{also|burger|Burger|Bürger}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Back-formation from {{m|en|hamburger}}, as if it were {{m|en|ham}} + {{m|en|-burger}}.

===Suffix===
{{en-suffix}}

# {{non-gloss definition|Used to make the names of [[hamburger]]s served in [[bun]]s with the addition of the specified [[foodstuff]], or with that foodstuff used in place of the usual meat.}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|en|-burger}}

